{
  "articles": [
    {
      "title": "豆瓣8.9，稳定才是最大的风险",
      "thumb_media_id": "AePEmFk8ZwibHEAn_R1JIVoKWVBR9vht2AYsxrgjtnS2gnSqj52kk0v_Us_dPqPm",
      "content": "<div style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 40px 10px; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; letter-spacing: 0.3px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 32px;\"><p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">大家好，我是马尔斯，书灯笔记的主理人。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你有没有发现一个很反直觉的现象：那些最稳定的工作，往往最容易被淘汰。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">铁饭碗碎了，大厂裁员了，曾经&quot;最安全&quot;的路，突然变成了最危险的。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">而另一些人，看起来一直在冒险——跳槽、创业、折腾副业——反而越活越稳。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这不是运气。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">这背后有一个被大多数人忽略的底层逻辑。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">今天想跟你聊聊《反脆弱》。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n</section>\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 32px;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 6px;\">01 稳定，才是最大的风险</h2>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这本书的作者纳西姆·塔勒布，是个很特别的人。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">他是华尔街的量化交易员，也是纽约大学的教授，还是个哲学家。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">他最擅长的事，就是打破人们对&quot;风险&quot;的认知。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">他提出了一个概念叫&quot;反脆弱&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">什么是反脆弱？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">不是&quot;不容易坏&quot;，而是&quot;越打击越强&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">玻璃杯掉地上会碎，这叫脆弱。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">塑料杯掉地上不会碎，这叫坚韧。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">但有一种东西，掉地上不仅不碎，还会弹得更高——这就是反脆弱。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">人体就是反脆弱的。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你去健身房举铁，肌肉纤维会被撕裂，然后长回来，而且比之前更强。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你打疫苗，就是往身体里注入微量病毒，让免疫系统变强。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">没有压力，就没有成长。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">但现代社会的一个大问题是：我们太追求稳定了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">稳定的工作、稳定的收入、稳定的生活。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">看起来很安全，实际上你正在失去应对变化的能力。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">塔勒布说了一句很狠的话：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">&quot;有些事情，没有波动，就是死亡的前兆。&quot;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">一条没有波澜的河，很快就会变成死水。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">一个永远不犯错的人，从来没有真正学习过。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n</section>\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 32px;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 6px;\">02 杠铃策略：90% 保守 + 10% 激进</h2>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">那怎么做到反脆弱呢？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">塔勒布给了一个很实用的策略：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">杠铃策略。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">想象一个杠铃。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">两头重，中间轻。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">把 90% 的精力放在极度安全的事情上，把 10% 的精力放在极度冒险的事情上。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"></strong> 中间地带——那些&quot;中等风险、中等回报&quot;的事，不要碰。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">举个例子。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你的收入结构：90% 来自稳定的工资，10% 用来尝试副业、投资、学习新技能。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">如果副业失败了，你不会饿死；如果成功了，你的收入会翻倍。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">再比如你的时间分配：90% 做确定性高的事情（本职工作、陪伴家人、保持健康），10% 去探索不确定性（认识新圈子、学一个完全不相干的技能、去一个没去过的地方）。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">关键在于：你永远有一个安全底线，同时保留了一个&quot;上不封顶&quot;的可能性。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">大多数人犯的错误是：把 100% 的精力放在&quot;中等安全&quot;的事情上。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">一份不上不下的工作，一段不好不坏的关系，一个不痛不痒的日常。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">看起来稳定，实际上最脆弱。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">因为一旦环境变化——行业裁员、公司倒闭、关系破裂——你没有退路，也没有新路。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n</section>\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; \"><h2 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 6px;\">03 拥抱小错误，远离大灾难</h2>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">塔勒布还有一个观点让我印象很深：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">要学会从小的错误中学习，同时避免犯致命的错误。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">什么叫致命的错误？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">就是一旦发生，你就再也翻不了身的事。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">比如：借高利贷去炒股、辞掉工作去创业但没有存款、在一段关系里完全失去自我。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这些事的共同点是：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">你把所有的鸡蛋放在了一个篮子里，而且这个篮子可能会摔。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">什么叫小的错误？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">就是发生了会疼，但不会要命的事。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">比如：尝试一个新项目失败了、学了一个新技能发现用不上、跟朋友坦诚说了一次&quot;不&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">小的错误是信息，大的错误是灾难。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">反脆弱的人，会主动制造&quot;小错误&quot;——因为他们知道，每一次小失败都在让自己变强。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">就像肌肉撕裂后会长得更壮一样。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">而不脆弱的人，会拼命避免所有错误——结果就是，他们从来没有真正变强过。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">一旦遇到真正的打击，直接崩溃。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">塔勒布说：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">&quot;风会熄灭蜡烛，却能让火越烧越旺。&quot;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你是蜡烛，还是火？</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">读完这本书，我做了一个决定：每个月至少做一件&quot;可能会失败但不会要命&quot;的事。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">上个月是学做视频，做得很烂，但我学会了剪辑。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这个月是在社群里分享了一个不成熟的想法，被反驳了，但我理清了思路。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">每一次小失败，都是一次免费的升级。</strong></p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">书灯笔记，用一本书，点亮一盏灯。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">我是马尔斯，我们下期见。</p>\n</section>\n</div>",
      "author": "马尔斯",
      "digest": "那些最稳定的工作，往往最容易被淘汰。塔勒布的《反脆弱》告诉你：越打击越强，才是真正的生存之道。",
